<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O, selfless love! ’Tis never unbecoming;</l><l>Purest affection “seeks not its own things;”</l><l>Never Provoked, not counting evil doing;</l><l>Let this love echo forth from my heart’s strings.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O noble love! In righteousness rejoicing,</l><l>A love that cheers whenever truth is king;</l><l>It covers all things, and believes in all things,</l><l>It hopes all things, and will endure all things.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O lasting love! It fades not, ne’er abating;</l><l>Timeless and strong, prevails o’er everything;</l><l>When knowledge fails, and gifts are unavailing;</l><l>May I be found in its eternal spring.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
